<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφροσύνη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφρων</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>folly, thoughtlessness,</i> freq. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδας καταπαυέμεν ἀφροσυνάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.457
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.278
			</span></i>: in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ τί σε χρὴ ταύτης ἀφροσύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.110
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				254
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦφαι ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1230
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφρόνησιν ἢ . . ἀ. μετωνόμασται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.122
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφροσύνη</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				332e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβαίνει ἡ ἀ. μετὰ ἀκρασίας ἀρετή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1146a27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
